                                "sense_id": "f1d2a829-bcc2-3061-a4e5-ce27e68e5eaf",
                                "text": "French winger Hatem Ben Arfa has also taken plenty of plaudits recently and he was the architect of the opening goal with some superb trickery on the left touchline."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78e14cf0-49d4-49ab-a9cb-ee7b74904a85",
                                "sense_id": "f1d2a829-bcc2-3061-a4e5-ce27e68e5eaf",
                                "text": "Some kids were having a kickabout on the grass beside the walkway, cheering, groaning, calling for the ball, absorbed in the game, a self-contained universe marked out by jackets for goalposts and invisible touchlines."
                            }
